      "sourceTextSha256": "4fa3a63b0c9762c6aad6d42e07923fc304e9844509ab311ac2d4c74fd907a09d",
      "text": "Day 2 · Breakfast. Your guide meets you in the hotel lobby for a half-day excursion (4 hours) to Sugar Loaf Mountain (Pão de Açúcar) with an English-speaking guide. From Praia Vermelha (Red Beach), a cable car takes you to Urca Hill, with its wide viewing platform, restaurants and bars, then on to Sugar Loaf, with views over Copacabana, Ipanema and Leme beaches, Guanabara Bay, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and Niterói, known for its Oscar Niemeyer architecture, and Christ the Redeemer on Corcovado. Then drive to the historic centre of old Rio, with its churches, monasteries and colonial-style buildings and, time permitting, the Metropolitan Cathedral and the Selarón Steps.",
