      "sourceTextSha256": "3c187ddc2b901017873fd8663bddfe071ade698dbb7ab9c587dbf63113108ed0",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, half-day excursion (4 hours) to Corcovado with an English-speaking guide. An open, eco-friendly train climbs through the jungle to the summit where, at 710 metres above sea level, stands the symbol of Rio, the 38-metre statue of Christ the Redeemer, erected in 1931, with a breathtaking panorama of the Rio–Niterói Bridge, Guanabara Bay, the Botanical Garden, the legendary Maracanã Stadium and Sugar Loaf.",
